グルが発表され、冠番組の『キミと愛なNight！』では、メンバーが楽器に挑戦する新企画が動き出す。そんな時、陸は「ブラック・オア・ホワイト」に出場していた狗丸トウマと出会う。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-07-18","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eoE6x8JcKTmysbHG8bCfkkjGpnA.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eoE6x8JcKTmysbHG8bCfkkjGpnA.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/76128/season/3/episode/3"},{"id":"3055060","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"An argument leads Mitsuki, Yamato, and Iori to leave the dorm. Iori and Mitsuki stay at Momo's place, while Yamato stays at Yuki's. Riku and the other boys left at the dorm feel increasingly sad to see their groupmates scattered.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-07-25","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qhxh3MkTM8LTib4I97RhOp9rqaH.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qhxh3MkTM8LTib4I97RhOp9rqaH.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/76128/season/3/episode/4"},{"id":"3055061","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"All seven members of IDOLiSH7 meet for the first time in a while at the studio. The recording session goes smoothly, but the other members anxiously watch the exchange between Mitsuki and Yamato. Sougo attempts to convince them to come back to the dorm, but when they refuse, he is at a loss.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-08-01","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7Bvf7e6BAtoyESouvvplXxQSu2F.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7Bvf7e6BAtoyESouvvplXxQSu2F.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/76128/season/3/episode/5"},{"id":"3055064","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Momo gets caught up in Ryo's scheme to expose Yamato's father Shizuo Chiba. When Yamato returns to the dorm, a delighted Nagi tells everyone that Yamato's first confession will be held that night, and the members of TRIGGER and Re:vale gather at the dorm.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-08-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/i45qIGfFtjbFq5woqt6szG0dZ0Y.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/i45qIGfFtjbFq5woqt6szG0dZ0Y.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/76128/season/3/episode/6"},{"id":"3055065","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The members of IDOLiSH7 cheerfully head to work. Sougo encounters Torao at the TV station. As sons whose families run major corporations, they've previously met. Meanwhile, at Iori and Tamaki's school, transfer student Haruka Isumi takes a confrontational attitude towards them.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-08-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qRNHKauk4HBuosDGR2N2vhVqvbQ.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qRNHKauk4HBuosDGR2N2vhVqvbQ.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/76128/season/3/episode/7"},{"id":"3055066","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Banri describes how he and Yuki met to the members of IDOLiSH7 and Tsumugi. During high school, they developed an interest in each other's songs, and eventually began making music together. Yuki named the band they started together \"Re:vale.\"","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-08-22","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1EnNfXgXFuBz6Jb4F7CgLDn60Sj.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1EnNfXgXFuBz6Jb4F7CgLDn60Sj.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/76128/season/3/episode/8"},{"id":"3055067","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Episodio 9","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Moved by Re:vale's concert, Momo writes a fan letter describing how \"Our Incomplete Selves\" made him feel. Banri and Yuki are touched by the letter, which encourages them to continue making music. Five years after the formation of their band, they're approached by a man named Kujo who offers to help them debut.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-08-29","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/p1nozJDIRpoILI8NsIORKeZa3ol.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/p1nozJDIRpoILI8NsIORKeZa3ol.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/76128/season/3/episode/9"},{"id":"3055068","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"IDOLiSH7 are selected to be personalities for the 24-hour program \"Friends Day\" along with Re:vale and TRIGGER. On the day of the production meeting, their 24-hour training camp to write a theme song for the program suddenly begins.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-09-05","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qNNYwB30eL0KMWO1QPhdBiHsIr0.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qNNYwB30eL0KMWO1QPhdBiHsIr0.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/76128/season/3/episode/10"},{"id":"3055069","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"With Re:vale composing the music, TRIGGER designing the choreography, and IDOLiSH7 designing costumes, through the combined efforts of all three groups, they barely manage to complete a song by the morning of their 24-hour theme song production training camp. Meanwhile, Ryo meets with Haruka, Toma, Minami, and Torao in his apartment.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-09-12","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/f6N9T1oWipbPaFupVybLRD83b9J.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/f6N9T1oWipbPaFupVybLRD83b9J.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/76128/season/3/episode/11"},{"id":"3055070","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"Episodio 12","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Thorvaldur, a man claiming to be \"Nagi's otaku friend,\" visits the dorm. He says he's worried about the dorm's security, but Riku and the other members fail to understand his true intentions. Meanwhile, media outlets report that Ryunosuke and popular singer Sumire Hanamaki are madly in love.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-09-19","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/Ysryvpgh0SnucCwdcbYkB2tkQy.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/Ysryvpgh0SnucCwdcbYkB2tkQy.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/76128/season/3/episode/12"},{"id":"3240718","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":13,"title":{"value":"Episodio 13","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"In order to prove Ryunosuke's innocence, Mitsuki, Nagi, and Gaku go to negotiate directly with Ryo. Yamato and Tenn attempt to persuade Sumire, but they fail to change her mind. Anesagi anxiously tells Tsumugi and Okazaki that she's concerned there's still more to come...","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-09-26","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/y6NqKjzglKLcSTYzVT7UzRgGePA.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/y6NqKjzglKLcSTYzVT7UzRgGePA.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/76128/season/3/episode/13"},{"id":"3964754","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":14,"title":{"value":"Episodio 14","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"ŹOOĻ makes a spectacular debut and has taken the spotlight. Meanwhile, TRIGGER's popularity is beginning to decline due to Ryunosuke's scandal. As the disquieting atmosphere unfolds, TRIGGER shows off their powerful singing and dancing on TV, but...","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-10-02","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cSzgK1X5EjlRDCQ4ht2HAyU9oRm.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cSzgK1X5EjlRDCQ4ht2HAyU9oRm.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/76128/season/3/episode/14"},{"id":"3997013","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":15,"title":{"value":"Episodio 15","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"TRIGGER goes missing when they're scheduled to perform at the Tokyo International Music Art Festival, so IDOLiSH7 and Re:vale work together to look for them. Ryunosuke is rescued sooner than the others thanks to Nagi's quick wits and rushes to Zero Arena, but...","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-10-09","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zRPnHo1pHW3ATpKZz0MakYhpeUZ.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zRPnHo1pHW3ATpKZz0MakYhpeUZ.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/76128/season/3/episode/15"},{"id":"3997014","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":16,"title":{"value":"Episodio 16","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"IDOLiSH7 and Re:vale watch on as TRIGGER check in on each other. Tenn informs Nagi that Kujo Takamasa received a living will from Sakura Haruki. Nagi is shaken by the possible clue to finding the man he's been looking for...","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-10-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rWABsg31cdlxhMwkvTfjvCEHZk2.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rWABsg31cdlxhMwkvTfjvCEHZk2.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/76128/season/3/episode/16"},{"id":"3997015","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":17,"title":{"value":"Episodio 17","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Sosuke decides to dissolve TRIGGER's contracts in order to protect Yaotome Agency. However, he allows them to continue calling themselves TRIGGER and sing their existing songs. With that in mind, Tenn and the others continue working independently and pledge to one another that they will aim to return to Zero Arena someday.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-10-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oS7UJHfHV1p71E4LVbV9T5fb5xF.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oS7UJHfHV1p71E4LVbV9T5fb5xF.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/76128/season/3/episode/17"},{"id":"3997028","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":18,"title":{"value":"Episodio 18","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"IDOLiSH7 and Re:vale begin receiving different types of jobs than they had been previously. They are obviously filling in for TRIGGER. Meanwhile, ŹOOĻ is taking on more and more work, and their popularity is skyrocketing. They even appear as guests on IDOLiSH7's show \"Lovely Night With You!\".","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-10-30","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ah6qlrsh8oD8OkgJdEVwMyb2vSm.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ah6qlrsh8oD8OkgJdEVwMyb2vSm.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/76128/season/3/episode/18"},{"id":"4042595","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":19,"title":{"value":"Episodio 19","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"IDOLiSH7のデビュー1周年ツアーが始まった。天に想いを馳せながら歌う陸の姿は観客の心を掴み、広がる大声援に一織は圧倒される。一方、TRIGGERは姉鷺と共に活動を再開させるが、ライブ会場探しに苦心していた……。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-11-06","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sz4HMspUxukqS1TfmrJZjvHkGY3.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sz4HMspUxukqS1TfmrJZjvHkGY3.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/76128/season/3/episode/19"},{"id":"4042596","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":20,"title":{"value":"Episodio 20","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"雨が降る駅前広場で幕を開けたTRIGGERの復活ライブ。突然現れたTRIGGERに感激するファンもいれば、嘲笑うように通り過ぎていく人もいる。そうした中で懸命に歌い踊る天の姿を、陸は熱い想いで見つめていた……。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-11-13","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4BhaUUmwFToEGLUVKr5TaYPZS8j.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4BhaUUmwFToEGLUVKr5TaYPZS8j.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/76128/season/3/episode/20"},{"id":"4042597","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":21,"title":{"value":"Episodio 21","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"陸の“訴求力”に気づいた一織。それはアイドルとして武器になるが、人を惹きつけるエネルギーが強すぎてコントロールできなくなる危うさも含んでいた。そんな陸の気がかりとなっているTRIGGERは、ライブ活動で行き詰まる。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-11-20","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cIEA4TcmYPT7tsLI4Ni7u45T0sU.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cIEA4TcmYPT7tsLI4Ni7u45T0sU.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/76128/season/3/episode/21"},{"id":"4042598","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":22,"title":{"value":"Episodio 22","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"実家に帰って、父親と和解する計画を立てた壮五。壮五は環を大事にしたいという思いから、MEZZO”のためにも問題点を改善したいと考えていた。一方で数日後、ŹOOĻがRe:valeの生放送番組にゲストとして出演し、注目される。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-11-27","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vszmlW66i2jOkdB2KUUA9xmkhOn.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vszmlW66i2jOkdB2KUUA9xmkhOn.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/76128/season/3/episode/22"},{"id":"4079981","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":23,"title":{"value":"Episodio 23","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"逢坂家で父親の壮志から冷淡な扱いを受ける壮五。反発した環に壮志は傷害の言いがかりをつけ、通報しないことを条件に、壮五に仕事を辞めるよう要求する。環を人質に取られ、壮五は一人で生放送のラジオ番組に出演するが……。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-12-04","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7bJ5ywlmdjkLAeVfeI4JYHnK8oJ.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7bJ5ywlmdjkLAeVfeI4JYHnK8oJ.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/76128/season/3/episode/23"},{"id":"4091036","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":24,"title":{"value":"Episodio 24","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"TRIGGERのライブは大成功を収め、楽と天と龍之介は改めて3人で共に歩んでいくことを誓い合う。世間の風向きも変わり「MOP」（Music Of People）の公式サイトでは、TRIGGERの順位が急上昇。その波に乗って、Re:valeも反撃を開始する！","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-12-11","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vHwgljihB1jUOEkBm8cxUSKDAiq.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vHwgljihB1jUOEkBm8cxUSKDAiq.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/76128/season/3/episode/24"},{"id":"4091037","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":25,"title":{"value":"Episodio 25","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Re:valeが仕掛けたTV出演以来、TRIGGERのライブ人気はさらに高まり、活躍の場も徐々に増えてきた。そんな時、IDOLiSH7とRe:valeが出演する24時間のチャリティ番組『Friends Day』の打ち合わせが行われる。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-12-18","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1pzEsbRYGaZwiTBaju8ajBAeeQS.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1pzEsbRYGaZwiTBaju8ajBAeeQS.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/76128/season/3/episode/25"},{"id":"4114411","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":26,"title":{"value":"Episodio 26","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"『Friends Day』の放送日を迎え、それぞれの担当コーナーで番組を盛り上げていくIDOLiSH7とRe:vale。メモリアルソングのコーナーでは視聴者にリクエストを募っていたが、一夜明けるとTRIGGERの曲が1位になっていた。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2022-12-25","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4XZ66PCGLuO0oQb9ODVrFbzTGmX.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4XZ66PCGLuO0oQb9ODVrFbzTGmX.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/76128/season/3/episode/26"},{"id":"4114413","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":27,"title":{"value":"Episodio 27","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"メモリアルソングのランキングからTRIGGERが消されてもファンの投票は続き、制作局長も視聴者の声を反映させると決断。百はIDOLiSH7がTRIGGERの曲を歌うことへの影響を考えるが、望まれた曲を歌うという陸の意志は固かった。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-02-05","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mDiYLDqxFFsGswfuTXiFSIjl15g.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mDiYLDqxFFsGswfuTXiFSIjl15g.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/76128/season/3/episode/27"},{"id":"4114414","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":28,"title":{"value":"Episodio 28","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"『Friends Day』でのライブが反響を呼び、IDOLiSH7とTRIGGERは「MOP」で3位を競うほど人気を増した。1位のRe:valeは後輩に舞台を譲るため辞退を表明するが、2位のŹOOĻも辞退したことで流れが変わってしまう。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-02-12","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bP8w1gGBmIPpjtR92d8r2NBAODd.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bP8w1gGBmIPpjtR92d8r2NBAODd.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/76128/season/3/episode/28"},{"id":"4114415","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":29,"title":{"value":"Episodio 29","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"百と連絡がとれず、心配した千はトウマを問い詰める。了に脅されていたトウマは押し黙るが、本気で怒った千に抗うことはできなかった。一方、ナギは巳波から桜春樹の命が長くないことを知らされ、ショックを受ける……。","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-02-19","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7hfR8erLQcLVTJEDaJFpTKBeZe5.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7hfR8erLQcLVTJEDaJFpTKBeZe5.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/76128/season/3/episode/29"},{"id":"4114416","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":30,"title":{"value":"Episodio 30","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"「MOP」の開催当日。ヤラセ疑惑や出来レースという声もある中、ステージに立ったIDOLiSH7とTRIGGERは、今の真っ直ぐな想いを歌で伝えようと、それぞれが最高のパフォーマンスを見せる。視聴者投票の集計結果は――？","language":"ja-JP"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-02-26","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lXA9Z1N1VkEF7yGs48zW7T0yZhW.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lXA9Z1N1VkEF7yGs48zW7T0yZhW.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/76128/season/3/episode/30"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/76128/season/3"},"failure":null,"fields":{},"episodes":{"1":{"checkedAt":1793459476483,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"2":{"checkedAt":1793459476483,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"3":{"checkedAt":1793459476483,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"4":{"checkedAt":1793459476483,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"5":{"checkedAt":1793459476483,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"6":{"checkedAt":1793459476483,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"7":{"checkedAt":1793459476483,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"8":{"checkedAt":1793459476483,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"9":{"checkedAt":1793459476483,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"10":{"checkedAt":1793459476483,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"11":{"checkedAt":1793459476483,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"12":{"checkedAt":1793459476483,"status":"ok","retryCount":0},"13":{"checkedAt":1793459476483,